abstract: >
  One figure from two generators: a shear-and-bind walk that never
  names an angle inside the step, and an n-gon of diameter n.
  Five parts: The Closed Unit; Without an Angle; Without a Landing;
  Meetings; Already There. Recorded walk 24 September 2026,
  h = 0.002, 200000 steps, 127 hits.
